{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"The random draw picked **Raiders of the Golden Goose**. The demo will follow one continuous expedition: a jungle approach, sun-lens puzzle, rival treasure hunters, a precarious idol swap, and a collapsing-temple escape. I’ve also read AI Hub’s supplied session protocol; online co-op will use a shared world, alongside standalone couch co-op."}}
