{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_81","type":"agent_message","text":"The four-seat startup fix is working. A packet-loss run exposed another edge case: one guest received no world snapshot before the host departed. I’m making the initial world snapshot reliable. I’ve also separated the two keyboard players’ Shift bindings and added a test for assisted touch jumps with partial stick input."}}
